      "review.wordtune.unlimited.words.5.brand.voices": "Unlimited words, 5 brand voices, workflows, priority support",
      "review.wordtune.used.by.over.10.million": "Used by over 10 million marketers and businesses worldwide, Wordtune excels at helping teams scale their content production without sacrificing quality. The platform's brand voice feature ensures consistency across all generated content, while its workflow automation capabilities allow teams to create repeatable processes for common copywriting tasks.",
      "review.wordtune.view.pricing": "View Pricing",
      "review.wordtune.what.sets.wordtune.apart.is": "What sets Wordtune apart is its focus on marketing and sales use cases with specialized workflows for different business needs. The platform combines GPT-4 technology with custom-trained models to generate copy that's not just grammatically correct, but persuasive and conversion-focused. From cold emails to landing pages, Wordtune understands marketing frameworks and applies them automatically.",
      "review.wordtune.word.limits.can.be.restrictive": "Word limits can be restrictive",
      "review.wordtune.wordsmonth": "Words/Month",
      "review.wordtune.wordtune.excels.at": "Wordtune Excels At:",
      "review.wordtune.wordtune.is.a.powerful.ai": "Wordtune is a powerful AI copywriting platform that helps marketers, entrepreneurs, and content creators generate high-converting marketing and sales copy in seconds. With over 90 AI-powered tools and templates, Wordtune streamlines the content creation process for everything from social media posts to sales emails, blog articles, and product descriptions.",
      "review.wordtune.wordtune.is.an.excellent.ai": "Wordtune is an excellent AI copywriting tool that delivers real value for marketers, sales teams, and content creators. Its Real-time specialized tools and templates make it easy to generate high-quality marketing copy quickly, while the workflow automation feature helps teams scale their content production efficiently. The generous free tier lets you test the platform thoroughly before committing. While it's not the best choice for long-form content or technical writing, Wordtune excels at its core mission: helping businesses create compelling sales and marketing copy that converts. The Pro plan at $49/month offers unlimited words and is perfect for solo marketers and small teams. If you need AI assistance for marketing copy, product descriptions, sales emails, or social media content, Wordtune is a solid investment that will save you hours of writing time.",
      "review.wordtune.wordtune.vs.jasper.ai": "Wordtune vs Jasper AI",
      "review.wordtune.wordtune.vs.writesonic": "Wordtune vs Writesonic",
      "review.wordtune.work.together.with.unlimited.team": "Work together with unlimited team members. Share brand voices, templates, and workflows across your organization.",
      "review.wordtune.writesonic.includes.ai.image.generation": "Writesonic includes AI image generation and Chatsonic (ChatGPT alternative), making it more versatile. Wordtune focuses purely on copywriting with better templates and workflows. Wordtune's brand voice training is more sophisticated, while Writesonic offers more features at similar prices."
