      "review.wordtune.explore.wordtunes.interface": "Explore Wordtune's interface:",
      "review.wordtune.faq1.answer": "Wordtune can generate over 90 different types of content including sales emails, blog posts, social media captions, ad copy, product descriptions, landing page copy, video scripts, email subject lines, and much more. Each template is optimized for specific marketing and sales use cases.",
      "review.wordtune.faq1.question": "What types of content can Wordtune generate?",
      "review.wordtune.faq2.answer": "Brand voice allows you to train Wordtune on your specific tone, style, and messaging. You provide examples of your existing content, and the AI learns your brand's unique voice. Once set up, all generated content will match your brand's personality, ensuring consistency across all marketing materials.",
      "review.wordtune.faq2.question": "How does the brand voice feature work?",
      "review.wordtune.faq3.answer": "The free plan provides 2,000 words per month indefinitely and includes access to all Real-time tools and templates. This is enough for creating social media posts, product descriptions, or testing different types of copy. It's not time-limited, making it genuinely useful for light users or those wanting to thoroughly test the platform.",
      "review.wordtune.faq3.question": "Is the free plan actually useful or just a trial?",
      "review.wordtune.faq4.answer": "Wordtune can generate SEO-friendly content including meta descriptions, blog outlines, and keyword-rich copy. However, it doesn't include built-in SEO analysis tools like keyword research or content scoring. You'll need to use separate SEO tools to optimize and analyze the content Wordtune generates.",
      "review.wordtune.faq4.question": "Can Wordtune help with SEO content?",
      "review.wordtune.faq5.answer": "Wordtune generates grammatically correct and coherent content, but it requires human review and editing. The AI excels at creating first drafts and overcoming writer's block, but you should always fact-check claims, verify information, and refine the output to match your specific needs and voice perfectly.",
      "review.wordtune.faq5.question": "How accurate is the AI-generated content?",
      "review.wordtune.faq6.answer": "Yes, all content generated with Wordtune is yours to use commercially. You own the rights to the output and can use it for marketing, sales, advertising, client work, or any other business purpose. However, always review and edit the content to ensure it meets your quality standards and brand guidelines.",
      "review.wordtune.faq6.question": "Can I use Wordtune content commercially?",
